  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable enterprises and SSE systems strengthened for resilience, productivity and inclusive recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on previous large-scale employment-intensive interventions implemented under the Emergency Response Plan, the ILO continues to support the design and delivery of inclusive employment-intensive programmes in the West Bank and Gaza that generate short-term decent work while contributing to recovery efforts.
In partnership with local chambers, the ILO will create temporary employment opportunities linked to public works and private sector recovery, while strengthening national capacity to implement employment-intensive approaches. In addition, under the JSB project, the ILO will work with vulnerable agricultural communities in the West Bank on the rehabilitation of productive agricultural assets using Employment-Intensive Investment Programme (EIIP) approaches, creating short-term decent jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
